who   : The Pak — The Pak Protectors (intelligence in service of kin — the builders).
what  : The species whose Protectors built the Ringworld. Tree-of-life turns adult to Protector — deathless, sexless, superhumanly smart, and incapable of caring for anything but their own bloodline. The builders, and the warning.
where : The Pak Protectors · intelligence in service of kin — the builders, within Ringworld.
why   : to hold the office this roll assigns: intelligence in service of kin — the builders.
when  : across the events of Ringworld (as the lineage records).
